<title>UK: Fannie Mae adds 250 mln stg to June 02 bond.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae adds 250 mln stg to June 02 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.25 billion stg from 1.0 billion stg, joint lead managers BZW and Merrill Lynch International said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FANNIE MAE</p>
<p> AMT  **1.25 BLN STG  COUPON     6.875     MATURITY    07.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.524    PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    99.524    SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**ORIGINAL 1.0 BLN STG LAUNCHED 11.FEB AT 99.821</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
